### 登录接口
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 获取科室下拉列表
GET http://localhost:8080/common/departments/select

### 获取科室下的医生列表
GET http://localhost:8080/common/doctors/select?departmentId=1

### 获取医生列表（管理员）
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 获取科室列表（管理员）
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 获取排班列表（管理员）
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 创建预约
POST http://localhost:8080/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "scheduleId": "1"
}

### 获取我的预约列表
GET http://localhost:8080/appointments/my
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 取消预约
POST http://localhost:8080/appointments/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 创建医生评价
POST http://localhost:8080/ratings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "doctorId": "1",
  "rating": 5,
  "content": "医生很专业"
}

### 获取医生评价列表
GET http://localhost:8080/ratings/doctor/1

### 获取我的评价列表
GET http://localhost:8080/ratings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}} 